sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant Drawer as DetailDrawer.jsx
  participant PDF as pdfReport.js
  participant APIjs as api.js
  participant API as POST /api/ai/summary
  participant AI as ai/summary.py
  participant Groq as Groq API
  participant Anth as Anthropic API

  User->>Drawer: Export PDF confirm
  Drawer->>PDF: downloadSingleCvePdf(cve, options)
  PDF->>APIjs: fetchCVESentences (optional enrich)
  PDF->>APIjs: POST /api/ai/summary
  APIjs->>API: request with session cookie
  API->>AI: generate_executive_summary
  AI->>Groq: _call_groq (if GROQ_API_KEY)
  alt Groq fails or no key
    AI->>Anth: _call_anthropic (if ANTHROPIC_API_KEY)
  end
  alt both AI fail
    AI-->>API: template summary (source template)
  else
    AI-->>API: AI JSON (source groq or anthropic)
  end
  API-->>PDF: executive_summary, key_findings, confidence, source
  PDF->>PDF: jsPDF layout + html2canvas sparkline
  PDF->>User: browser download .pdf

  Note over PDF: No API keys required for the CVE feed;<br/>AI summary section is empty until Groq or Anthropic key is set.
